# polaris_web/requirements-patroni.in: the HA supervisor inside the database image
# (v9.243, roadmap P2.7). Installed by Dockerfile.postgres from the compiled,
# hashed requirements-patroni.txt; a container that runs the default `postgres`
# command never imports any of it. The image is Alpine, so the lock is compiled
# there (postgres:16-alpine, its python3):
#   pip-compile --generate-hashes --allow-unsafe --strip-extras \
#       --output-file=requirements-patroni.txt requirements-patroni.in

