# Held below 1.5 BY PATRONI, not by preference: patroni 4.1.5 declares
# ydiff!=1.4.0,!=1.4.1,<1.5,>=1.2.0, so 1.5 makes the image unbuildable
# ("Cannot install patroni and ydiff==1.5"). Dependabot proposed 1.5 on
# 2026-09-16, it was applied, and every container job went red until it was
# reverted; dependabot.yml now ignores it. Raise this only when patroni's
# own upper bound moves.
ydiff==1.4.2
